      "counterfactual": "If a service-routing change had occurred and required an attachment, the blank field would indicate non-compliance with that requirement.",
      "competingExplanation": "The blank field may simply reflect administrative oversight rather than a missing routing change; no evidence confirms whether a routing change actually existed or was needed.","evidenceGap":"No record of service-routing changes affecting this boundary between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024. No confirmation that the blank field implies non-compliance with an existing requirement for temporary instruction attachment when a routing change occurs."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-vay2a6",
      "toKey": "n-1qdd5sx",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "When a service-routing change affects an existing maintenance boundary, the affected ECP must be revised or have an approved temporary instruction attached. The point register (IA-P02) maps signals but does not establish the state of any distribution valve.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds": [
        "eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1"
      ],
      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual": "If the point register had established valve states, it could confirm whether a routing change occurred or if valves were open contrary to procedure.",
      "competingExplanation": "The point register maps signals but does not prove every supply disturbance would appear in its export; thus, absence of an entry does not rule out a physical interruption.","evidenceGap":"No evidence that the blank temporary instruction field corresponds to a missing service-routing change or valve state. No record confirms whether external factors (third-party work, utility outage) affected the supply."
